== no TLS unit
smtp implicit: smtp: TLS needs a TLS unit and none is linked
imap implicit: imap: TLS needs a TLS unit and none is linked
smtp starttls required: smtp: STARTTLS needs a TLS unit and none is linked
S: EHLO localhost\r
smtp auto, STARTTLS offered and no unit: sent in the clear
S: EHLO localhost\r
S: MAIL FROM:<a@b.c>\r
S: RCPT TO:<d@e.f>\r
S: DATA\r
S: x\r
S: .\r
S: QUIT\r
imap starttls: imap: STARTTLS needs a TLS unit and none is linked
imap starttls not offered: imap: server doesn't support STARTTLS
== with an upgrader
smtp auto sent, upgrader calls 1 for 127.0.0.1
S: EHLO localhost\r
S: STARTTLS\r
S: EHLO localhost\r
S: MAIL FROM:<a@b.c> BODY=8BITMIME\r
S: RCPT TO:<d@e.f>\r
S: DATA\r
S: x\r
S: .\r
S: QUIT\r
smtp starttls refused by the server: 454 "TLS not available" upgrader calls 0
S: EHLO localhost\r
S: STARTTLS\r
smtp handshake failed: smtp: the TLS handshake failed
S: EHLO localhost\r
S: STARTTLS\r
imap starttls: tls=1 plain=1 starttls=0 upgrader calls 1 for 127.0.0.1
S: A1 STARTTLS\r
S: A2 CAPABILITY\r
imap starttls refused: ALERT TLS is down
S: A1 STARTTLS\r
